{
  "defaultAction": "SCMP_ACT_ERRNO",
  "architectures": ["SCMP_ARCH_X86_64", "SCMP_ARCH_X86", "SCMP_ARCH_X32"],
  "comment": "判题沙箱 seccomp 白名单（Task 7，设计 6.2）。默认拒绝；socket/connect/accept 等网络系统调用、mount/umount、ptrace、keyctl、bpf、userfaultfd、kexec、reboot、swapon/off、setns、unshare、clone 带 NEWUSER/NEWNS 标志等一律拒绝。允许 clone（线程创建，Java/Python 运行时必需）。Java JVM 需要的少量额外调用（memfd_create、eventfd2、timerfd、sched_getaffinity 等）已包含。",
  "syscalls": [
    {
      "names": [
        "read", "readv", "pread64", "preadv", "preadv2",
        "write", "writev", "pwrite64",
        "open", "openat", "openat2", "close", "close_range",
        "stat", "fstat", "lstat", "newfstatat", "statx", "statfs", "fstatfs",
        "lseek", "llseek",
        "access", "faccessat", "faccessat2", "readlink", "readlinkat", "getcwd",
        "dup", "dup2", "dup3", "fcntl",
        "ioctl",
        "poll", "ppoll", "select", "pselect6",
        "mmap", "munmap", "mprotect", "mremap", "madvise", "brk", "sbrk",
        "mincore", "msync",
        "clone", "clone3", "fork", "vfork", "execve", "execveat",
        "wait4", "waitid", "waitpid",
        "exit", "exit_group", "_exit",
        "rt_sigaction", "rt_sigprocmask", "rt_sigreturn", "rt_sigpending",
        "rt_sigtimedwait", "rt_sigsuspend", "sigaltstack", "kill", "tgkill",
        "set_tid_address", "set_robust_list", "get_robust_list", "rseq",
        "futex", "getpid", "getppid", "gettid", "getuid", "geteuid",
        "getgid", "getegid", "getresuid", "getresgid", "getgroups",
        "clock_gettime", "clock_nanosleep", "clock_getres", "gettimeofday",
        "nanosleep", "time", "alarm", "pause",
        "getrusage", "getrlimit", "prlimit64",
        "sched_getaffinity", "sched_yield", "sched_getscheduler", "sched_get_priority_max", "sched_get_priority_min",
        "getrandom", "sysinfo", "uname", "arch_prctl",
        "getdents", "getdents64",
        "pipe", "pipe2", "eventfd", "eventfd2", "memfd_create",
        "timerfd_create", "timerfd_settime", "timerfd_gettime",
        "epoll_create", "epoll_create1", "epoll_ctl", "epoll_wait", "epoll_pwait",
        "restart_syscall", "prctl", "setrlimit", "umask", "chdir", "fchdir",
        "unlink", "unlinkat", "rename", "renameat", "renameat2", "mkdir", "mkdirat",
        "rmdir", "truncate", "ftruncate", "fsync", "fdatasync", "sync_file_range",
        "copy_file_range", "sendfile",
        "gethostname", "syslog"
      ],
      "action": "SCMP_ACT_ALLOW"
    },
    {
      "names": ["prctl"],
      "action": "SCMP_ACT_ALLOW"
    }
  ],
  "seccomp_errno_for_denied": 13,
  "notes": [
    "被拒绝的系统调用返回 EPERM(13) 而非杀死进程：正常程序不应触发；",
    "恶意探测（socket/connect/mount/ptrace 等）会失败并由 Agent 将",
    "频繁 SIGSYS/EPERM 探测样本映射为 BSC（受限系统调用）并记安全审计。",
    "no_new_privs 由沙箱运行时强制设置，本文件不依赖被测程序配合。"
  ]
}
